/**
 * @file inputImpedanceInfinite.cnl
 * Test case for linNet.
 *
 * An op-amp based input follower has an infinite impedance. This is
 * calculated correct by linNet but the resulting Octave code creates a
 * transfer function object, which Octave would fail to calculate. The M
 * code generator of linNet adds an error message to the script in order
 * to avoid confusion.
